bounded by 216 meet the floor `1/109`.  Cover-capacity certificate: 36 parts, capacities
summing to 107 < 108, using 183 witness times (split style). -/
theorem dense_floor_m108_split (v : Fin 108 → ℤ) (hv : ∀ i, 0 < v i)
    (hinj : Function.Injective fun i => (v i).toNat)
    (hden : ∀ i, (v i).toNat ∈ Finset.Icc 1 216) :
